header_text {
  translation {
    text: "Route 323 notice: beginning Sun Jan 4."
    language: "en"
  }
}
description_text {
  translation {
    text: "Change\r\nMinor changes to weekday and Saturday schedules.\r\n\nReason\r\nImprove on-time performance and service reliability per reroute to Coffman/8th, removing detour via Bross/8th.\r\n\nSurvey Results\r\nOut of 4 respondents, 75% reported a positive impact from the change, 25% indicated it had no impact, and 0% perceived the change negatively.\r\n\nEffective January 4, 2026\r\nWith expected completion of the Coffman Street Mobility Improvements Project by the end of 2025, RTD will resume service to the bus stops at the RTD Park-n-Ride at 8th Avenue. and Coffman Street. The stops were moved in June 2024 to a temporary location directly across Roosevelt Park on Bross St. between 8th Avenue. and Longs Peak Avenue. The RTD Park-n-Ride has remained open during construction.\r\n\nCustomers can also access the Longmont FlexRide service at the southwest corner of the Park-n-Ride.\r\nThe Coffman Street Mobility Improvements project extends from 1st Avenue. to 9th Avenue. and will become a world-class multi-modal corridor that will include robust public transit (local, regional and BRT buses)."
    language: "en"
  }
}
